## fetchRequestBody (body-4)

Wraps the captured bodyInputStream and consumes available byte chunks, appending character-code strings until no bytes remain.

- reads: request.bodyInputStream; available byte count
- writes: Consumes stream; local body string
- branches: While loop ends when available() is zero.
- result: Complete concatenated string for this available stream.
- errors: Stream constructor/read errors propagate.
- async: Synchronous; does not wait for future chunks.
- ownership: Local BinaryInputStream wrapper; no explicit close here.

